This repository contains the task folders of Terminal-Bench 2.1, from
https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1 and the Harbor registry
dataset terminal-bench/terminal-bench-2-1, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The task authors are named in each task's task.toml.

Modifications: the first commit imports the 89 task folders unchanged. Every
later change to a task folder is its own commit, and is described in
fixes/<task>.md, with its reason and class (port, drift or defect). Each
modified task.toml points at an image built from this repository.

The container images built from these folders contain third-party software
(operating system packages, language packages, datasets and other files) under
their own licences, as do the upstream Terminal-Bench images they are built to
match.

make-doom-for-mips and make-mips-interpreter vendor doom.wad in their environment folders. It is
doom1.wad, the shareware data file of DOOM v1.9 by id Software (4196020 bytes, sha256
1d7d43be501e67d927e415e0b8f3e29c3bf33075e859721816f652a526cac771). id Software's shareware licence
permits redistributing it unmodified and without charge. It is included unmodified.
